---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Ruben Lupi">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>I'm Ruben, a software engineer. I'm especially interested in
    why complex systems behave the way they do: where the boundaries sit, how feedback travels, and what we can
    see when something goes wrong.</p>
    <p>This blog is where I think in public about software architecture, systems thinking, platform engineering
    and agentic AI. Posts are short and opinionated, and I'll change my mind in them when I learn something.</p>
    <p>The views here are my own.</p>
    <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href={SITE.github} rel="me">GitHub</a></li>
      <li><a href={SITE.linkedin} rel="me">LinkedIn</a></li>
      <li><a href="/cv_rubensanchez_swengineer.pdf">CV (PDF)</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
